* The lab's treat dispenser (openc2e Creatures 2 project, our own script and
* our own art from tools/sprites/labtreat.py; owner, 2026-11-09: "maybe it
* should have some sort of special treat for any creatures who make it
* there"; then "more on theme" with the lift). A glass cylinder of gel drops
* in worn steel and bronze, like the lift pod (2 3 236, sprite zltd),
* stands on the lab floor (room 32, y 1544) just inside the left door, in front of the console (plane 1450, behind creatures). When a
* creature comes within sight (RNGE 400) it pops a gel drop out of its chute
* (2 25 145, sprite zltt, plane 1460), at most one every 30
* seconds and while fewer than three lie about; a creature (or the hand)
* can also push it. A drop is a sweet that also cheers: chemicals 37 hunger
* decrease 40, 70 glucose 50, 36 pleasure-need decrease 90, 45 boredom
* decrease 90. An uneaten drop melts away after about five minutes.
* OV00 the cooldown (in 10-tick steps). Run by openc2e after the world loads
* (Additions folder); made anew each load.

enum 2 3 236 kill targ next
enum 2 25 145 kill targ next

inst
new: simp zltd 2 0 1450 0
setv cls2 2 3 236
setv attr 4
bhvr 1 0
setv rnge 400
pose 0
mvto 4026 1494
setv ov00 0
tick 10
slow

* every 10 ticks: count down, and treat a creature in sight
scrp 2 3 236 9
  doif ov00 gt 0 subv ov00 1 endi
  doif ov00 eq 0
    setv var1 0
    esee 4 0 0 setv var1 1 next
    doif var1 eq 1 gsub give endi
  endi
  subr give
  doif totl 2 25 145 lt 3
    setv ov00 30
    pose 1 snde pop2
    setv var0 posl addv var0 12
    setv var1 post addv var1 38
    rndv var2 0 2
    inst
    new: simp zltt 1 var2 1460 0
    setv cls2 2 25 145
    setv attr 195
    bhvr 0 64
    setv accg 3 setv rest 30 setv aero 2
    mvto var0 var1
    setv grav 1
    rndv var3 3 6 setv velx var3
    setv vely -4
    tick 3000
    slow
    targ ownr
    wait 12 pose 0
  endi
  retn
endm

* pushed by a creature or the hand: the same, if it is ready
scrp 2 3 236 1
  doif ov00 eq 0
    doif totl 2 25 145 lt 3
      setv ov00 30
      pose 1 snde pop2
      setv var0 posl addv var0 12
      setv var1 post addv var1 38
      rndv var2 0 2
      inst
      new: simp zltt 1 var2 1460 0
      setv cls2 2 25 145
      setv attr 195
      bhvr 0 64
      setv accg 3 setv rest 30 setv aero 2
      mvto var0 var1
      setv grav 1
      rndv var3 3 6 setv velx var3
      setv vely -4
      tick 3000
      slow
      targ ownr
      wait 12 pose 0
    endi
  endi
  setv actv 0
endm

* a gel drop: eaten, or melts away
scrp 2 25 145 12
  snde chwp
  stim writ from 30 255 0 0 37 40 70 50 36 90 45 90
  kill ownr
endm
scrp 2 25 145 9
  kill ownr
endm
